-- section 4.13 defer: DEFER-01 block form (check-only positive)
-- @req: DEFER-01
-- @expected-pass-after: phase-32
-- The `defer { ... }` block form must parse and check once the gate (E0276) is
-- removed and the parser widens the defer body from `iron_parse_expr` to a
-- general statement. RED now: `ironc check` still emits E0276. The CTest
-- asserts E0276 ABSENT via whole-pipeline negation; flips GREEN in Plan 32-02.
-- Block defers run LIFO-as-a-unit at the fall-through exit, so the block body
-- runs in source order on that single edge: intended stdout `body`, `a`, `b`.

func main() {
    defer {
        print("a")
        print("b")
    }
    print("body")
}
